Main Play Area&quot; must be moved in descending order and of alternating colors. Except for the King (K), no other cards can be placed in an empty position.<br></li><li>Cards in a particular cell of the &quot;Recycle Area&quot; must be placed in ascending order and of the same suit.</li></ul>",
